{
 "label": "WORKTREES · CLAUDE CODE",
 "accentWords": [
  "worktree",
  "branch",
  "catch",
  "default",
  "unpushed",
  "head",
  "save",
  "follow",
  "fix",
  "step"
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "text": "Two Claude Code sessions in the same folder can step on each other's edits.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "hero",
    "headA": "TWO SESSIONS",
    "headB": "ONE FOLDER",
    "icon": "branch",
    "node": {
     "t": "EDITS COLLIDE",
     "at": "step",
     "cls": "red"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "text": "The fix is a git worktree: a separate checkout, on its own branch. Start Claude with the worktree flag, and a name.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "stack",
    "items": [
     {
      "k": "chips",
      "label": "a git worktree is",
      "chips": [
       {
        "t": "separate checkout",
        "at": "checkout"
       },
       {
        "t": "own branch",
        "at": "branch"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "k": "term",
      "text": "claude --worktree feature-auth",
      "at": "Start"
     }
    ],
    "title": "THE FIX"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "text": "Claude puts it in your worktrees folder, on a new branch named after it.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "stack",
    "items": [
     {
      "k": "chips",
      "label": "created for you",
      "chips": [
       {
        "t": ".claude/worktrees/feature-auth",
        "at": "folder",
        "cls": "am"
       },
       {
        "t": "worktree-feature-auth",
        "at": "branch",
        "cls": "ac"
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
    "title": "WHAT IT CREATES"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "text": "Here's the catch. By default, a new worktree branches from your default branch, not your current work. Your unpushed commits aren't in it.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "stack",
    "items": [
     {
      "k": "rows",
      "label": "a new worktree starts from",
      "rows": [
       {
        "t": "default branch (remote)",
        "tag": "STARTS HERE",
        "cls": "hot",
        "at": "default#1"
       },
       {
        "t": "your unpushed commits",
        "tag": "NOT INCLUDED",
        "tagCls": "red",
        "cls": "dim",
        "at": "unpushed"
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
    "title": "THE CATCH"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "text": "To start from your current work instead, set the baseRef setting to head.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "stack",
    "items": [
     {
      "k": "code",
      "label": "settings.json · from the docs",
      "at": "set",
      "lines": [
       {
        "t": "{"
       },
       {
        "t": "  \"worktree\": {"
       },
       {
        "t": "    \"baseRef\": \"head\"",
        "at": "head",
        "hl": true
       },
       {
        "t": "  }"
       },
       {
        "t": "}"
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
    "title": "THE SETTING"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "text": "Save this for your next session. Follow for more Claude Code workflows.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "cta"
   }
  }
 ]
}